A: Your current structure seems to be mixing up the syntax of C#. A part of your code is using VB syntax like Dim [...] as [...]. 
Moreover, you had too many closing brackets. Also, it seems you are trying to implement UnitTesting, your code isn't even compiling due to syntax errors as there are missing class definitions.
For implementing a UnitTesting, please use a structure that looks like this:
using NUnit.Framework;
using Microsoft.Pex.Framework;
