[TestFixture]
public class ArrayListTests
{
    [PexMethod]
    public void PUT_AddContract([PexAssumeUnderTest]ArrayList arrList, int x)
    {
         //Put your test cases here
    }
}

If you still need to use VB.Net syntax, please specify if you need some specific VB.Net syntax specific to ArrayList.
